{"id": "1608bdcd-7db9-4e53-8d52-0189c1c32313", "slug": "synapse-decentralized-compute-1", "title": "Synapse - Decentralized Compute", "description": "Synapse Decentralized Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Synapse - Decentralized Compute\"\ndescription: \"Synapse Decentralized Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4ADE80\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#BBF7D0\"\n  background: \"#FDFDFD\"\n  surface: \"#BBF7D0\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Grotesk\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Synapse - Decentralized Compute\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 527; favorites: 29; remixes: 9.\nTags: login, animated, webgl, threejs, security, input, validation, effect.\n## Overview\nSynapse Decentralized Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nSYNAPSE Overview Network Pricing Features Documentation Sign in Decentralized Processing Global Scale. Zero Friction. Boundless Compute. Execute intensive models in real-time. Route workloads seamlessly. Distribute task…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Global Scale. Zero Friction. Boundless Compute..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4ADE80, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #BBF7D0, background #FDFDFD, surface #BBF7D0, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Space Grotesk for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Synapse - Decentralized Compute</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-space-grotesk\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\">\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#FDFDFD] text-gray-900 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-green-200 selection:text-green-900\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-2] pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Diagonal Background Texture -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[-1] opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, #000 0, #000 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Structural Grid Lines & Framed Layout -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-50 flex justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full relative\">\n            <!-- Boundaries -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-gray-200/60\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-gray-200/60\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 top-0 h-[1px] bg-gray-200/60\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 bottom-0 h-[1px] bg-gray-200/60\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Corner L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[-1px] top-[-1px] w-3 h-3 border-l border-t border-green-500\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-[-1px] top-[-1px] w-3 h-3 border-r border-t border-green-500\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[-1px] bottom-[-1px] w-3 h-3 border-l border-b border-green-500\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-[-1px] bottom-[-1px] w-3 h-3 border-r border-b border-green-500\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"relative z-40 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-0 py-6 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-200/60\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-normal tracking-wide uppercase font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">SYNAPSE</span>\n            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 mb-2\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-normal text-gray-600\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Overview</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Network</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Pricing</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Features</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Documentation</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-700 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Sign in</a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Section -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-0 min-h-[85vh] flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center pt-12 lg:pt-0\">\n\n        <!-- Left Content -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[55%] flex flex-col items-start z-20 relative\">\n\n            <!-- Badge -->\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-green-200 bg-green-50/50 mb-8\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#FDFDFD, #FDFDFD) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80, #14532d) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-linear\" class=\"text-green-500 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-gray-800 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Decentralized Processing</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline with Masked Reveal -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight font-normal text-gray-900 mb-6\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal block font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif] tracking-tighter\">Global Scale.</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal block font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif] tracking-tighter\">Zero Friction.</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal block text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 via-green-400 to-green-300 font-['Space_Grotesk',sans-serif] tracking-tighter\">Boundless Compute.</span></div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-[28rem] leading-relaxed mb-10 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">\n                Execute intensive models in real-time. Route workloads seamlessly. Distribute tasks across edge devices, serverless environments, and dedicated hardware. Secure. Resilient. Built for the modern web.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Actions -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-20\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#1a1a1a] text-white text-sm font-normal rounded-full hover:bg-black transition-all font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">\n                    Deploy your first node\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-base group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 text-green-600 text-sm font-normal rounded-full hover:bg-green-50/50 transition-colors font-['Geist',sans-serif]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#FDFDFD, #FDFDFD) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80, #14532d) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                    Contact Enterprise\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Features -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap lg:flex-nowrap items-center gap-8 lg:gap-12 w-full\">\n                <!-- Feature 1 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-50 flex items-center justify-center text-green-500 shrink-0 border border-green-100/50\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#f0fdf4, #f0fdf4) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80, #bbf7d0) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-900 tracking-tight font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Ultra-Low Latency</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Execution</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Feature 2 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-50 flex items-center justify-center text-green-500 shrink-0 border border-green-100/50\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#f0fdf4, #f0fdf4) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80, #bbf7d0) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-900 tracking-tight font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Intelligent Load</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Balancing</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Feature 3 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-50 flex items-center justify-center text-green-500 shrink-0 border border-green-100/50\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#f0fdf4, #f0fdf4) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80, #bbf7d0) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-900 tracking-tight font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Fault-Tolerant</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5 font-['Geist',sans-serif]\">Architecture</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Visual -->\n        <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-full lg:w-[65%] h-full z-0 pointer-events-none hidden md:block\">\n\n            <!-- Intense Glow Background (Mouse responsive) -->\n            <div class=\"glow-orb-1 absolute top-[20%] right-[-10%] w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-[radial-gradient(var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-green-500 via-green-400 to-transparent rounded-full opacity-70 blur-[80px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"glow-orb-2 absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[10%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-[radial-gradient(var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-green-300 to-transparent rounded-full opacity-50 blur-[100px]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Vertical Glass Panes -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex justify-end\">\n\n                <!-- Pane 1 (Leftmost, widest, least blur) -->\n                <div class=\"relative h-full w-[18%] border-l border-white/40 shadow-[-15px_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(2px);\">\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Pane 2 -->\n                <div class=\"relative h-full w-[16%] border-l border-white/50 shadow-[-20px_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\">\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Pane 3 -->\n                <div class=\"relative h-full w-[15%] border-l border-white/60 shadow-[-25px_0_50px_rgba(255,255,255,0.7)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\">\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Pane 4 -->\n                <div class=\"relative h-full w-[14%] border-l border-white/70 shadow-[-30px_0_60px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\">\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Pane 5 (Rightmost, tightest, most blur) -->\n                <div class=\"relative h-full w-[12%] border-l border-white/80 shadow-[-35px_0_70px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\">\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Soft overlay gradient to blend edges -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FDFDFD] via-[#FDFDFD]/80 to-transparent w-[35%]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#FDFDFD] via-transparent to-[#FDFDFD] opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // GSAP Masked Reveal Animation\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.from(\".gsap-reveal\", {\n                y: \"110%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // Mouse-responsive gradients\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 100;\n                const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 100;\n\n                gsap.to('.glow-orb-1', {\n                    x: x * 1.5,\n                    y: y * 1.5,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n\n                gsap.to('.glow-orb-2', {\n                    x: -x * 1.2,\n                    y: -y * 1.2,\n                    duration: 2,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\"\n                });\n            });\n        });\n\n        // 3D WebGL Object Integration\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.outputEncoding = THREE.sRGBEncoding;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Perspective camera to capture depth and scale\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(35, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.z = 15;\n\n            // Faceted Geometric Shape\n            const geometry = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(2.8, 0);\n\n            // Physically-based Material showing metallic reflections\n            const material = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                color: 0x16a34a,     // Brand green base\n                emissive: 0x064e3b,  // Subtle dark emerald emission\n                roughness: 0.15,     // Low roughness for highlight sharpness\n                metalness: 0.85,     // High metalness for reflections\n                flatShading: true    // Reveals geometric facets\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            // Lighting setup\n            const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.4);\n            scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n            // Primary Key Light\n            const mainLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 1.5);\n            mainLight.position.set(10, 10, 10);\n            scene.add(mainLight);\n\n            // Colored Fill Light for depth\n            const fillLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x4ade80, 0.8);\n            fillLight.position.set(-10, -5, 5);\n            scene.add(fillLight);\n\n            const resize = () => {\n                const width = window.innerWidth;\n                const height = window.innerHeight;\n                renderer.setSize(width, height);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n                camera.aspect = width / height;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n\n                // Align to right behind the glass panes on desktop\n                if (width < 1024) {\n                    mesh.position.set(0, 0, -2);\n                } else {\n                    mesh.position.set(4, 0, 0);\n                }\n            };\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            let time = 0;\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                time += 0.01;\n\n                // Subtle rotation\n                mesh.rotation.x = time * 0.2;\n                mesh.rotation.y = time * 0.3;\n\n                // Smooth floating motion\n                mesh.position.y = Math.sin(time * 1.5) * 0.3;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n        };\n\n        // Initialize 3D Object\n        initWebGL();\n\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "synapse-decentralized-compute-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/synapse-decentralized-compute-1.jpg", "source_name": "synapse-decentralized-compute-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 1472, "forks": 60, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T14:54:02.604278+00:00"}